text = "How to Play

Click the button of the mob or turret you want to spawn.

Left-click to spawn a mob, and right-click to spawn a turret.

Mobs move to the right of the screen.

Turrets shoot mobs automatically. You gain score for killing mobs with turrets.

If a mob reaches your base, it will damage the base and die.

The goal is to get the highest score possible before your base is destroyed."
